{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-12-22 10:00:00', 'title': "COMERICA BANK RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES FOR THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': "DALLAS, DEC. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO NEWSWEEK'S 2022 LIST OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES. THIS MARKS THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR COMERICA HAS MADE THE LIST RECOGNIZING COMPANIES FROM ACROSS THE COUNTRY POSITIVELY IMPACTING THEIR COMMUNITIES THROUGH ENVIRONMENT, SOCIAL AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE (ESG) INITIATIVES."}